                                "sense_id": "0d005c91-1a6e-3231-98ef-04b62f8cb7b8",
                                "text": "James Ford Rhodes contributes a thoughtful paper on history; Ethel Pufier treats of the dread of loss of personality; Clement Smith gives a foreview of the American College of the Twentieth Century."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "713bc5fb-fa37-4f73-8a59-a3327c447874",
                                "sense_id": "0d005c91-1a6e-3231-98ef-04b62f8cb7b8",
                                "text": "Dr. Scofield continues: \"It is incredible that in a prophecy covering the church period there should be no such foreview. [...]\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "53aa83de-9053-4f2c-9403-c3481fc3bd7b",
                                "sense_id": "0d005c91-1a6e-3231-98ef-04b62f8cb7b8",
                                "text": "Most conclusively of all, these messages do present an exact foreview of the spiritual history of the Church, and in this precise order."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
