                                "sense_id": "6bc1ce85-ac17-3960-a4f4-f6f21ac75b1a",
                                "text": "Despite the long drive, the position was irresistible because the campus serves as a test site for advanced networking technologies. She glances in the \"foreview\" mirror to check the traffic."
